  "question": "Where can I find a park that are within 30 kilometers and lie east of Dwarfskill Preserve, Milford, PA?",
  "sql": "\nWITH origin AS  (SELECT ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-74.895166 41.300832)',4326)::geography AS geometry)\nSELECT * FROM pois, origin\nWHERE ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-74.895166 41.300832)',4326)::geography, 30000)\nAND leisure = 'park'\nAND degrees(ST_Azimuth(origin.geometry, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN 67.5 AND 112.5;\n",
